      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>A dot on the menu-bar icon now tells you when an update is ready.</li>
<li>You get a one-time notification when a new version is available. Click it to see what's new and install.</li>
<li>Settings › General › Updates shows the waiting version with an <b>Install</b> button.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
