    <item>
      <title>Version 1.0.0</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:09:08 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>1</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>First public release.</li>
<li>Clicking a window's red × quits the whole app, like ⌘Q. Hold ⌥ Option to close just the window.</li>
<li>Apps hide instantly while they quit and come back if they ask to save.</li>
<li>Exclude any app; Finder and system components are always excluded.</li>
<li>Automatic updates.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
